# Clients

- Web styling is Tailwind. Mobile styling is NativeWind.
- Screens to keep aligned: today, outfits, outfits/new, outfits/[id], discover, location. Admin review is web-only.
- After create, show the outfit immediately and upload in the background.
- The upload tray stays mounted across the signed-in screens.
- Reload during `uploading` shows Retry for that same outfit id.
- Today lists the owner's `ready` matches only. Discover is the public search.

```tsx
// BAD — blocking the form until moderation finishes
await uploadBytes(file);
await waitUntilReady(id);

// GOOD
const outfit = await createOutfit(input);
navigate("/outfits");
void uploadTracker.start(outfit, file);
```
